<title>ITALY: BankItaly asked prices around 990 lire/mark-dealer.</title>
<headline>BankItaly asked prices around 990 lire/mark-dealer.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Italy asked for prices at around the lira's central parity within the Exchange rate mechanism of 990 lire to the mark, foreign exchange dealer said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Earlier the lira skidded almost half a percentage point to within a whisker of the central parity rate.</p>
<p>The lira was later quoted at 988.80/9.15 lira to the mark. Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
